e-box{flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:center}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"mp-sommer\">\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n\n    <div class=\"review-head\">\n        <div class=\"pub\">Fragrance editorial team</div>\n        <div class=\"date\">July 2026</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:32px\">Summer special 2026</p>\n    <h1>The 5 best fragrance dupes for summer 2026</h1>\n    <p class=\"standfirst\">Smell luxurious without luxury prices: we tested the most popular summer dupes from €12.99 and reveal which ones are truly worth it.</p>\n    <p class=\"byline\">By <strong>the editorial team</strong> &middot; 10 min read</p>\n\n    <figure>\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0700/7928/3458/files/hero-sommer.jpg?v=1784440853\" alt=\"Drei Magic Perfume Flakons auf einer sonnigen Sommer-Terrasse am Meer\" width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" loading=\"eager\">\n    </figure>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <p>Summer is the most demanding season for perfume. <strong>Heat and sweat break down weak fragrances in minutes.</strong> Only fragrances with high concentrations and the right notes last.</p>\n\n    <p>At the same time, no one wants to spend €100+ on a fragrance that fades after two hours at 35°C. The solution: fragrance dupes — perfume alternatives that come up to 90% close to the originals but cost a fraction of the price.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"callout\">\n        <strong>Our test:</strong> We tested dupe versions of the 5 most popular summer fragrances for heat resistance, longevity, scent accuracy and value for money. The result: <strong>One supplier clearly stands out.</strong>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <!-- Quick Pick Table -->\n    <h2>Quick overview: our top 5</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"h2h\">\n        <table>\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>#</th>\n                    <th>Fragrance dupe</th>\n                    <th>Inspired by</th>\n                    <th>Price (100ml)</th>\n                    <th>Rating</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr class=\"win\">\n                    <td>1 <span class=\"tag\">TOP</span></td>\n                    <td>Magic Perfume No. 221</td>\n                    <td>Acqua Di Gio</td>\n                    <td>€22,99</td>\n                    <td>9.5 / 10</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>2</td>\n                    <td>Magic Perfume No. 034</td>\n                    <td>YSL Libre</td>\n                    <td>€22,99</td>\n                    <td>9.3 / 10</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>3</td>\n                    <td>Magic Perfume No. 338</td>\n                    <td>Sauvage Parfum</td>\n                    <td>€22,99</td>\n                    <td>9.2 / 10</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>4</td>\n                    <td>Magic Perfume No. 252</td>\n                    <td>Chanel Bleu</td>\n                    <td>€22,99</td>\n                    <td>9.0 / 10</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>5</td>\n                    <td>Magic Perfume No. 192</td>\n                    <td>JPG Scandal</td>\n                    <td>€22,99</td>\n                    <td>8.8 / 10</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <!-- Duft 1: Acqua di Gio -->\n    <div class=\"prod\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">#1 summer fragrance — test winner</p>\n        <h3>Magic Perfume No. 221</h3>\n        <div class=\"original\">Inspired by: Acqua Di Gio by Giorgio Armani (original: ~€85 / 100ml)</div>\n        <div class=\"score\">9.5 / 10 <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span></div>\n\n        <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0700/7928/3458/files/mp-221.jpg?v=1784440852\" alt=\"Magic Perfume No. 221 am Pool mit Limette und Rosmarin\" width=\"1792\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n\n        <div class=\"notes\">\n            <span class=\"note top\">Top: citrus, bergamot</span>\n            <span class=\"note heart\">Heart: jasmine, rosemary</span>\n            <span class=\"note base\">Base: musk, cedarwood</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"specs\">\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Scent accuracy</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.4 / 10</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Summer suitability</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.8 / 10 — perfect all-rounder</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Longevity (30°C+)</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.0 / 10 — lasts thanks to 19–21% concentration</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Value for money</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.8 / 10</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"proscons\">\n            <div class=\"pro\">\n                <h4>Pros</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Perfect summer all-rounder</li>\n                    <li>19–21% fragrance oil — lasts in the heat</li>\n                    <li>Fresh without being overpowering</li>\n                    <li>Suitable for the office and the beach</li>\n                    <li>Guaranteed compliments</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"con\">\n                <h4>Cons</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Very well-known scent — not especially distinctive</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"verdict\">The ultimate summer classic as a fragrance dupe — and honestly, almost indistinguishable from the original. The <strong>19–21% fragrance oil concentration</strong> is crucial here: while the original Eau de Toilette often fades after 4–5 hours in summer heat, the Magic Perfume version lasts even longer thanks to its higher concentration. Aquatic, fresh citrus notes meet a warm musk base. Perfect for every summer day.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"price-box\">\n            <div class=\"orig\">Original: <s>€85,00</s> / 100ml</div>\n            <div class=\"dupe\">€22,99 / 100ml</div>\n            <div class=\"save\">You save: €62,01 (73%)</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <a href=\"https://magicperfume.co/products/magic-perfume-no-221m\" class=\"btn\">Buy No. 221 at Magic Perfume →</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Duft 2: YSL Libre -->\n    <div class=\"prod\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">#2 summer fragrance</p>\n        <h3>Magic Perfume No. 034</h3>\n        <div class=\"original\">Inspired by: Libre by Yves Saint Laurent (original: ~€95 / 90ml)</div>\n        <div class=\"score\">9.3 / 10 <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span></div>\n\n        <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0700/7928/3458/files/mp-034.jpg?v=1784440852\" alt=\"Magic Perfume No. 034 im goldenen Abendlicht mit Lavendel und Orange blossom\" width=\"1792\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n\n        <div class=\"notes\">\n            <span class=\"note top\">Top: mandarin, lavender</span>\n            <span class=\"note heart\">Heart: jasmine, orange blossom</span>\n            <span class=\"note base\">Base: vanilla, musk</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"specs\">\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Scent accuracy</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.2 / 10</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Summer suitability</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.5 / 10 — ideal for warm evenings</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Longevity (30°C+)</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.2 / 10 — 12+ hours</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Value for money</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.6 / 10</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"proscons\">\n            <div class=\"pro\">\n                <h4>Pros</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Perfect balance: fresh + warm</li>\n                    <li>Lavender note ideal for warm evenings</li>\n                    <li>12+ hours of lasting fragrance</li>\n                    <li>Versatile: suitable for day and night</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"con\">\n                <h4>Cons</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>The vanilla base can feel heavy in extreme heat</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"verdict\">YSL Libre is one of the most successful fragrances for women in recent years — and Magic Perfume No. 034 captures the scent remarkably well. The combination of fresh lavender and warm orange blossom makes this dupe perfect for mild summer evenings. The vanilla base keeps the scent from fading too quickly, allowing it to develop elegantly over hours.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"price-box\">\n            <div class=\"orig\">Original: <s>€95,00</s> / 90ml</div>\n            <div class=\"dupe\">€22,99 / 100ml</div>\n            <div class=\"save\">You save: ~€82 (78%)</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <a href=\"https://magicperfume.co/products/034w-yves-saint-laurent-libre-ersatz\" class=\"btn\">Buy No. 034 at Magic Perfume →</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Duft 3: Sauvage -->\n    <div class=\"prod\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">#3 summer fragrance</p>\n        <h3>Magic Perfume No. 338</h3>\n        <div class=\"original\">Inspired by: Dior Sauvage Parfum (original: ~€120 / 100ml)</div>\n        <div class=\"score\">9.2 / 10 <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span></div>\n\n        <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0700/7928/3458/files/mp-338.jpg?v=1784440853\" alt=\"Magic Perfume No. 338 auf Schiefer mit Bergamotte bei Abenddämmerung\" width=\"1792\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n\n        <div class=\"notes\">\n            <span class=\"note top\">Top: bergamot, pepper</span>\n            <span class=\"note heart\">Heart: lavender, Sichuan pepper</span>\n            <span class=\"note base\">Base: ambroxan, vanilla</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"specs\">\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Scent accuracy</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.3 / 10 — almost identical</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Summer suitability</b> <span class=\"warn\">8.2 / 10 — better for the evening</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Longevity (30°C+)</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.6 / 10 — impressive</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Value for money</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.6 / 10</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"proscons\">\n            <div class=\"pro\">\n                <h4>Pros</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Sauvage — the world’s bestselling fragrance for men</li>\n                    <li>Incredible longevity, even in the heat</li>\n                    <li>Almost identical to the original</li>\n                    <li>Save €97 per bottle</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"con\">\n                <h4>Cons</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Can feel overpowering in extreme heat (35°C+)</li>\n                    <li>Better for the evening than the beach</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"verdict\">Dior Sauvage is the world’s bestselling fragrance for men — and Magic Perfume No. 338 comes so close to the original that even perfume specialists struggled to tell them apart in the blind test. The higher concentration (19–21% vs. the original Parfum concentration) ensures the scent lasts all day, even on hot summer days. On particularly hot days, we recommend spraying sparingly — the projection is impressive.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"price-box\">\n            <div class=\"orig\">Original: <s>€120,00</s> / 100ml</div>\n            <div class=\"dupe\">€22,99 / 100ml</div>\n            <div class=\"save\">You save: €97,01 (81%)</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <a href=\"https://magicperfume.co/products/magic-perfume-no-338m\" class=\"btn\">Buy No. 338 at Magic Perfume →</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Duft 4: Bleu -->\n    <div class=\"prod\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">#4 summer fragrance</p>\n        <h3>Magic Perfume No. 252</h3>\n        <div class=\"original\">Inspired by: Chanel Bleu de Chanel (original: ~€110 / 100ml)</div>\n        <div class=\"score\">9.0 / 10 <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span></div>\n\n        <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0700/7928/3458/files/mp-252.jpg?v=1784440853\" alt=\"Magic Perfume No. 252 auf Marmor mit Zitrone, Minze und Zedernholz\" width=\"1792\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n\n        <div class=\"notes\">\n            <span class=\"note top\">Top: lemon, mint, grapefruit</span>\n            <span class=\"note heart\">Heart: jasmine, Iso E Super</span>\n            <span class=\"note base\">Base: cedarwood, sandalwood</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"specs\">\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Scent accuracy</b> <span class=\"ok\">8.8 / 10</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Summer suitability</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.4 / 10 — perfect for the office</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Longevity (30°C+)</b> <span class=\"ok\">8.8 / 10</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Value for money</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.6 / 10</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"proscons\">\n            <div class=\"pro\">\n                <h4>Pros</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>The most elegant summer fragrance in the test</li>\n                    <li>Perfect for the office and formal occasions</li>\n                    <li>Fresh citrus opening</li>\n                    <li>Woody base stays subtle in the heat</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"con\">\n                <h4>Cons</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Less noticeable than Sauvage or AdG</li>\n                    <li>More understated — not a statement scent</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"verdict\">Bleu de Chanel stands for understated elegance — the fragrance you wear when you do not want everyone in the room to know which perfume you are wearing, but you want to impress the person next to you. Magic Perfume No. 252 strikes this balance well. The fresh citrus opening is perfect for hot days, while the woody base develops subtly throughout the day. A summer fragrance for connoisseurs.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"price-box\">\n            <div class=\"orig\">Original: <s>€110,00</s> / 100ml</div>\n            <div class=\"dupe\">€22,99 / 100ml</div>\n            <div class=\"save\">You save: €87,01 (79%)</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <a href=\"https://magicperfume.co/products/magic-perfume-no-252m\" class=\"btn\">Buy No. 252 at Magic Perfume →</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Duft 5: Scandal -->\n    <div class=\"prod\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">#5 summer fragrance</p>\n        <h3>Magic Perfume No. 192</h3>\n        <div class=\"original\">Inspired by: Jean Paul Gaultier Scandal (original: ~€80 / 80ml)</div>\n        <div class=\"score\">8.8 / 10 <span class=\"stars\">★★★★☆</span></div>\n\n        <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0700/7928/3458/files/mp-192.jpg?v=1784440852\" alt=\"Magic Perfume No. 192 auf einer Rooftop-Bar bei Sonnenuntergang mit Blutorange und Honig\" width=\"1792\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n\n        <div class=\"notes\">\n            <span class=\"note top\">Top: blood orange, mandarin</span>\n            <span class=\"note heart\">Heart: honey, gardenia</span>\n            <span class=\"note base\">Base: caramel, patchouli</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"specs\">\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Scent accuracy</b> <span class=\"ok\">8.6 / 10</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Summer suitability</b> <span class=\"warn\">7.8 / 10 — better for evenings</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Longevity (30°C+)</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.0 / 10</span></div>\n            <div class=\"s\"><b>Value for money</b> <span class=\"ok\">9.4 / 10</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"proscons\">\n            <div class=\"pro\">\n                <h4>Pros</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Unique honey-caramel scent</li>\n                    <li>Perfect for summer evenings and parties</li>\n                    <li>Strong sillage — a compliment magnet</li>\n                    <li>Very good longevity</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"con\">\n                <h4>Cons</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Too sweet for extreme daytime heat</li>\n                    <li>Not ideal for the office</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"verdict\">Scandal is the fragrance for women who want to stand out. The sweet honey-caramel combination is provocative and seductive — perfect for summer evenings, rooftop bars and parties. It is a little too intense for everyday wear at 35°C, but once the sun goes down, this fragrance dupe truly shines. Magic Perfume No. 192 captures the sweetness of the original surprisingly well without smelling cheap.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"price-box\">\n            <div class=\"orig\">Original: <s>€80,00</s> / 80ml</div>\n            <div class=\"dupe\">€22,99 / 100ml</div>\n            <div class=\"save\">You save: ~€77 (77%)</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <a href=\"https://magicperfume.co/products/magic-perfume-no-192w\" class=\"btn\">Buy No. 192 at Magic Perfume →</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <!-- Why Section -->\n    <h2>Why Magic Perfume takes all 5 spots</h2>\n\n    <p>Although we originally wanted to compare different suppliers, the test quickly showed: <strong>Magic Perfume is the only supplier offering 19–21% fragrance oil concentration</strong> at a price of €22.99.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"callout\">\n        <strong>Fragrance oil concentration compared:</strong><br>\n        Magic Perfume: <strong>19-21%</strong> (Eau de Parfum) — €22,99/100ml<br>\n        ÉCLAT: ~10-12% (Eau de Toilette) — €25-30/100ml<br>\n        La Rive: ~5-8% (Eau de Toilette) — €5-10/100ml<br>\n        <br>\n        <em>Higher concentration = a more intense scent + longer wear. Especially important in summer.</em>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>That means: with Magic Perfume, you get not only the lowest price per ml, but also the <strong>highest quality</strong> — a rare case where the cheapest product is also the best.</p>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <!-- Conclusion -->\n    <div class=\"guarantee\">\n        <div class=\"k\">Verdict</div>\n        <div class=\"big\">73-81%</div>\n        <h3>Savings compared with the originals</h3>\n\n        <ul>\n            <li>All 5 summer fragrance dupes from Magic Perfume impress with 90%+ scent accuracy</li>\n            <li>19–21% fragrance oil concentration provides 12+ hours of wear — even in the heat</li>\n            <li>From €12.99 (30ml) / €22.99 (100ml) — no other supplier offers this combination</li>\n            <li>Cruelty-free and fast shipping within Germany</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <a href=\"https://magicperfume.co/products/6x-50ml-parfumflaschen\" class=\"btn\">Discover all summer fragrances at Magic Perfume →</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Trust -->\n    <div class=\"trust\">\n        <div><div class=\"num\">4.6/5</div><div class=\"lab\">Trustpilot</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"num\">19-21%</div><div class=\"lab\">Fragrance oil</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"num\">12h+</div><div class=\"lab\">Longevity</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"num\">€22,99</div><div class=\"lab\">100ml</div></div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mps-footer\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <p>This comparison was created independently. Last updated: July 2026.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0\">All brand names mentioned are used only to describe the fragrance notes. The products are not made or endorsed by the named brands.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
